    "byFile": {
        "_readme": [
            "Pairs whose meaning depends on where they sit. Every entry names a surface",
            "that is dark BY DESIGN — the admin header, the drawer, the login and setup",
            "backdrops, and the tenant components' own local token blocks. There, white",
            "is not 'on-accent' and amber is not 'warning': they are the chrome's own",
            "foreground and highlight, and they must NOT follow the theme, or the drawer",
            "labels turn black on black the moment somebody enables dark mode.",
            "",
            "Plus the three catalogue-entity dots, where amber means 'bundle' rather than",
            "'warning' — the same value, three rows apart from a violet 'feature' and a",
            "sky 'quota' dot."
        ],

